%e A398094 T(6, 2) = 2. The two ordered difference sequences having exactly two reconstructions modulo complementation are (2, 1, 3, 5, 4), represented by (2, 4, 3, 6, 1, 5) and (3, 5, 4, 1, 6, 2), and (4, 5, 3, 1, 2), represented by (2, 6, 1, 4, 3, 5) and (2, 6, 1, 4, 5, 3), together with their complements.
